These release assets redistribute a Core ML conversion of the following works, under their original licenses.
It is a DERIVATIVE WORK; the modifications are listed below.

1. tarteel-ai/whisper-base-ar-quran  — Apache License 2.0
   https://huggingface.co/tarteel-ai/whisper-base-ar-quran (commit 5c3c53fdf9272c4f6ee0bee09a1e5a4a615ee25c)
2. OpenAI Whisper (the model above is a fine-tune of openai/whisper-base) — MIT License
   https://github.com/openai/whisper

MODIFICATIONS (no retraining, no fine-tuning, no change to the learned weights' values beyond numeric precision):
  - PyTorch weights (pytorch_model.bin) were loaded with torch.load(weights_only=True) and re-saved as safetensors.
  - generation_config.json was taken from openai/whisper-base (alignment heads); the models are fine-tuned from those checkpoints.
  - The only modification is the conversion to Core ML and shipping the official tokenizer.json — no training or fine-tuning.
  - The models were converted to Core ML (.mlmodelc, float16) with Argmax whisperkittools (MIT) — WhisperAudioEncoder,
    WhisperTextDecoder and MelSpectrogram, in the layout expected by WhisperKit (argmaxinc/argmax-oss-swift, MIT).
  - tokenizer.json / tokenizer_config.json are copied unchanged from openai/whisper-base (MIT); the models' vocab.json was verified to be a subset with identical ids.
Conversion scripts: tools/tasmee-model in https://github.com/yalabdullmohsen/SSUNNAH

Provenance caveat: the upstream model card does not document the training dataset. The Apache-2.0 license of the weights
is as published by the upstream authors.

